<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Is it real?\'92 one of riot cops mumbled.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Another cop gave the first a slap with a riot shield.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91What?\'92 Alexander asked.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Is it real?\'92 a different cop asked. \'91Do you really execute those low-lives?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Alexander snorted and smiled for his own satisfaction.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Cos, if it is, how do we get in on it?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Yeah, is there, like, a way you can apply to work on the show?\'92 asked another.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91The waiting list is nine years,\'92 Alexander said, aiming to sound sympathetic.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The cops moaned. \'91Just tell us, then. Are the executions real?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>A cop sitting at the far end of the cabin, clutching a sniper rifle, grimaced and shook his head.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Tell me where we\'92re going first,\'92 Alexander said.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Bomb attack. In the Pale.\'92\
